                <block name="heading">CCAMLR CONVENTION AREA</block>
            </container>
        </preface>
        <mainBody>
            <paragraph>
                <content>
                    <p>Exploratory fishing for toothfish in the CCAMLR Convention Area in 2019/2020
                        shall be limited to the following:</p>
                </content>
            </paragraph>
            <paragraph>
