            <paragraph>
                <hcontainer name="BLOCK_TAB">
                    <num>Table B</num>
                    <heading>TACs and by-catch limits</heading>
                    <subparagraph>
                        <content>
                            <p>The TACs set out below, which are adopted by CCAMLR, are not allocated to CCAMLR members and hence the Union’s 
                                share is undetermined. Catches are monitored by the CCAMLR Secretariat which will communicate to the Contracting 
                                Parties when fishing is to be ceased due to TAC exhaustion</p>
                        </content>
